Unknown: Probably small.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.980
DM: Compared to like gas leaks, it's gotta be pretty small.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:14.380
Unknown: Right.

00:00:16.219 --> 00:00:17.520
DM: Okay. So we pick up

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:20.620
DM: as you

