00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:27.000
DM: After defeating the fiend.

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:35.640
DM: So at this point, you know, things seem quiet on the island, although there must be some activity down in the...

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:40.420
