00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:10.699
Unknown: We should, [clears throat] get under cover sooner rather than later.

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:11.600
DM: Yeah. You-

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.420
Delwath: Go into the temple

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:14.560
DM: ... go into the temple.

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:15.760
DM: Um-

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:17.060
Seeker: We teleported

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:18.480
