00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:19.240
Seeker: Directly inside the temple.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.640
DM: Okay. So you're in the temple.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:24.140
DM: [clicks tongue] Um, Dimitar,

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:28.980
