Wellby: I think you're gonna like it.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:42.320
Unknown: Yeah.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:43.940
Kenzo: Not in the short run. You're gonna like it.

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:44.500
DM: Uh,

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:46.260
DM: tell me more.

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:48.780
Unknown: Well, well, we, we

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:50.760
Delwath: broke, um,

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:54.520
Unknown: Ra'ghemdros.

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:56.120
