00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:53.920
Wellby: It's a top.

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:55.320
Delwath: Um, hey, Dim. By the way...

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:57.840
Unknown: Wait, did I do see invisible?

