00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:03.800
Unknown: Like,

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:05.860
Delwath: uh, when we started combat.

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:07.740
Delwath: No, I didn't. I'm gonna say it wasn't.

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:09.560
DM: You did it with the... You only did it in the-

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:10.500
Unknown: I mean-

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:11.200
Unknown: ... vests

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:12.220
