00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:24.320
Unknown: Wait, does the top still spin?

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.200
Unknown: Yeah, I'm gonna, I'm gonna see invisible.

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:28.320
Kenzo: Is the top still spinning?

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:30.440
DM: Dimitar's looking at it.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:30.800
Unknown: Is there a-

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:31.760
DM: What's it supposed to do?

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:33.060
Unknown: Is there an eye?

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:34.640
DM: No, there's not an eye.

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:36.140
Unknown: Wait, wait. It's supposed to

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.120
